### Fun Facts

- The stadium was the first in the UK to feature a fully covered, all‑seated design with a retractable roof on the main stand.  
- It was renamed “Etihad Stadium” in 2012 after Etihad Airways became the club’s principal sponsor.  
- The “Etihad Campus” is one of Europe’s most tech‑savvy sports complexes, boasting a 3‑G network that lets fans stream high‑definition video from any seat.  

